                    {
                        "sense_id": "0f2df1e1-df2c-3cf3-9831-40a0356b0423",
                        "entry_id": "dc3ce6c5-aadd-361a-b4b3-350ae864913a",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A preliminary model or sketch used in preparation for making a sculpture."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "57ca6572-8e7b-4657-9e82-09eaa15a9753",
                                "sense_id": "0f2df1e1-df2c-3cf3-9831-40a0356b0423",
                                "text": "His presence would be an affront to my body; so, for it, there would be the rare delight of extinguishing an imperfect and distressed version of itself, a prototype, a maquette."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "68efa059-5bd9-4b43-9163-259acf3591ce",
                                "sense_id": "0f2df1e1-df2c-3cf3-9831-40a0356b0423",
                                "text": "And I thought, if I can imagine this place in real life, I can build it in the studio and then paint from the maquette as if it were a real landscape. In terms of process this was a breakthrough for me[…]"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
